t", "sub": "mp-sp-relation", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 18, "text": "If a4+ b4 = −a2 b2, then a6 − b 6 = ?", "options": [{"text": "1", "added": false}, {"text": "0", "added": false}, {"text": "−1", "added": false}, {"text": "2", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Algebra", "sub": "identities", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 19, "text": "Seema can finish a work in 7 days, while Kartik can finish the work in 12 days. The manager asked them to do the work together so that the work can be completed earlier. How many days will they take to complete the work together?", "options": [{"text": "4.42 days", "added": false}, {"text": "4.89 days", "added": false}, {"text": "5.12 days", "added": false}, {"text": "3.42 days", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Time-Work", "sub": "together-apart", "key_answer": null}, {"n": 20, "text": "In a village, if the ratio of men to women is 3 : 2, then the percentage of men in the village is:", "options": [{"text": "80%", "added": false}, {"text": "60%", "added": false}, {"text": "90%", "added": false}, {"text": "70%", "added": false}], "options_source": "real", "image_only": false, "topic": "Percentage", "sub": "basic-percentage", "key_answer": null}]}